      "field": "capital / 订单（B 轮新闻稿）",
      "claim": "Pickle Robot 官方新闻稿（2024-11-20）：完成 5000 万美元 B 轮融资；2024 年第三季度有六家客户下单订购 30 台以上量产机器人，计划于 2025 年上半年部署，订单包含试点转化、既有客户扩容与新客户采用；Pickle Unload Systems 自 2023 年夏季起已在多个客户的分拨中心以量产状态运行；累计卸货超过 1000 万磅货物；公司目标为十年内实现 100 万个仓库月台的进出库自动化",
      "quote": "Cambridge, Mass., November 20, 2024 - Pickle Robot Company (“Pickle Robot”), a pioneer in Physical AI delivering robotic automation systems that unload trucks, today announced it has raised $50 million in series B funding … Additionally, in Q3 2024 six customers placed orders for over 30 production robots to deploy in the first half of 2025. The new orders include pilot conversions, existing customer expansions, and new customer adoption. … Pickle Unload Systems have been operating at production capacity in distribution centers for multiple customers since the summer of 2023. … To date, Pickle Robots have unloaded over 10 million pounds of merchandise from import containers and domestic floo…",
