      "claim": "第三方分析文章转述：UPS 将投资 1.2 亿美元采购 400 台用于卡车卸货的机器人（其 90 亿美元自动化计划的一部分），订单指向 Pickle Robot；UPS 计划于 2026 年下半年至 2027 年在多个设施部署 Pickle 机器人；单个机器人约两小时可卸完一辆典型卡车；该文注明信息来自不愿具名人士，且 Pickle 通过发言人拒绝置评",
      "quote": "United Parcel Service Inc. will invest $120 million in 400 robots used to unload trucks, according to people familiar with the matter … The UPS order puts a spotlight on Pickle Robot Co., a Charlestown, Massachusetts-based startup already … UPS will deploy Pickle Robots in multiple facilities in the latter half of 2026 and into 2027, said the people, who spoke on condition of anonymity since they were not authorized to share the details publicly. … Through a spokesperson, Pickle declined to comment on the purchase.",
